# Force LF line endings for files executed inside Linux containers, regardless
# of the host's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows checkouts with
# autocrlf=true silently corrupt start_gunicorn.sh with CRLF endings, which
# crash-loops the backend container (dash reads blank lines as a literal "\r"
# command and, once `set -e` is active, exits immediately).
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
